OL,3,GNEWSAAll you need to know about the
OL,4,AMerseyrail closures
OL,5,
OL,6,FRail passengers in Liverpool face up to
OL,7,Fa month of major disruption as work to
OL,8,Fupgrade Victorian-built Merseyrail
OL,9,Ftunnels begins next week.
OL,11,FWaterproofing work will take place on
OL,12,Ffour underground tunnels carrying
OL,13,FNorthern Line services into Liverpool.
OL,15,FMerseyrail said the #3.5m project would
OL,16,Freduce the risk of power failures and
OL,17,Funplanned closures, making the tunnels
OL,18,Fmore suitable for the 21st century.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
